 "discarded_first_draw": {
  "what": "a first draw (2026-09-29, before the context criterion of the brief was applied) bucketed by data bytes (<10 KB, 10 KB-1 MB, >1 MB) and drew graph20-20-1rand, ex1010-pi, enlight_hard, beasleyC2, ramos3, gsvm2rl11, and PGLib-UC rts_gmlc/2020-11-25 + ca/2014-12-01_reserves_0",
  "why_discarded": "the frozen prompts forbid reading files, so data must be inline; beasleyC2, ramos3, gsvm2rl11 and the ca instance cannot fit num_ctx inline. ex1010-pi names a data file the repository does not contain. The rule was restated (v2 seeds) before the new draw; the downloaded files of the discarded instances were deleted and their solves were stopped, except one: the CBC solve of rts_gmlc/2020-11-25, started at 03:13 UTC under the first draw (before the v2 draw), ran to its 1800 s limit and is the reference solve of pglib_uc-0001, because the v2 seed drew the same day (same instance, model and solver options; corrected 2026-09-29 by the E22 verification from the file and solve-record timestamps)"
 },
